### Desktop build (desktop/)
# Its own Gradle user home and smoke-test scratch dirs live in the repository so that a sandboxed
# or offline build never has to write outside it.
.gradle-desktop/
.smoke/
.tmp-src/

### Android build (.android-gradle-run.ps1)
# Same reasoning as the desktop one, for the Android half: a sandboxed session cannot write to
# %USERPROFILE%\.gradle or .android, so this script points both at the repository.
.gradle-android/
.android-home/

# The packaged desktop application, copied out of build/ so that `gradlew clean` cannot erase the
# ready-to-run folder (about 160 MB: it carries its own Java runtime and the Skia renderer).
desktop/dist/
.mingw/
.tmp-*/
.tmp-build/
.wix311/
.msi-input/
.wixprobe/
.android-*.ps1
.build-msi.ps1
.release-notes*.md
.commit-msg*.txt
.cargo-home/
.local-build.log
.build-local-apk.ps1